        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The map below shows the changes that have taken place at a zoo in Australia between 1960 and now. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The map below shows the changes that have taken place at a zoo in Australia between 1960 and now. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "explain": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - A traditional and modern two-storey Japanese house</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải </strong><strong>th&iacute;ch </strong><strong>đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về c&aacute;ch bố tr&iacute; một ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; Nhật Bản hai tầng theo phong c&aacute;ch truyền thống v&agrave; hiện đại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề&nbsp; với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: c&aacute;ch bố tr&iacute; một ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; Nhật Bản hai tầng -&nbsp;\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">theo phong c&aacute;ch truyền thống v&agrave; hiện đại.</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Maps, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về những thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2FVdfJ0poHUFaxZXjWl4zeEgsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những thay đổi nổi bật nhất:</strong> Bố cục tầng dưới c&oacute; <strong>thiết kế \"kh&ocirc;ng gian mở\" hơn</strong> v&agrave; tr&ecirc;n lầu c&oacute; <strong>nhiều ph&ograve;ng hơn</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ELJudHj9coLcrAxKkdZlua63gUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những điểm kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi: </strong><strong>Ph&ograve;ng ngủ truyền thống kiểu </strong><strong>N</strong><strong>hật</strong> c&oacute; cửa trượt v&agrave; <strong>tủ quần &aacute;o </strong>để cất nệm<strong> futon</strong> khi kh&ocirc;ng d&ugrave;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm khu vực<strong> dựa tr&ecirc;n khu vực:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả bố cục truyền thống v&agrave; những thay đổi của tầng trệt ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave;</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ok5od1Rt9oTgPxxGxITlmtCbgOk\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Theo bố cục truyền thống, cửa ra v&agrave;o nằm ở b&ecirc;n phải, c&ugrave;ng b&ecirc;n với sảnh ch&iacute;nh; b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i l&agrave; một ph&ograve;ng tắm v&agrave; nh&agrave; bếp biệt lập.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TEqbdRI8uogLGzxvxnclN5l2gkd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Ở ph&iacute;a cuối căn ph&ograve;ng l&agrave; một ph&ograve;ng ngủ truyền thống được trải s&agrave;n rơm tatami, với một tủ quần &aacute;o ri&ecirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EEV9dJN0goaowzxp1Cnlf6N3gIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> Trong bố cục hiện đại, ph&ograve;ng ngủ đổi chiều - nằm dọc theo chiều d&agrave;i căn ph&ograve;ng, thế chỗ nh&agrave; bếp cũ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JgYzdEMrroCtpQxCcZNl5gDSg8b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 4: </strong>Đồng thời, vị tr&iacute; của nh&agrave; tắm được đổi th&agrave;nh kh&ocirc;ng gian bếp mở, v&agrave; phần kh&ocirc;ng gian c&ograve;n lại (b&ecirc;n phải) được d&ugrave;ng l&agrave;m khu vực ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng ăn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: M&ocirc; tả tương tự cho tầng tr&ecirc;n</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja3ydJ3RMoHaTAxFtzNlYtCxgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Ở tr&ecirc;n lầu, bố cục cũ c&oacute; 2 ph&ograve;ng ngủ tatami c&oacute; cửa trượt.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Si6ldEYyoouZBEx2H24l8pL6gmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Bố cục hiện đại thay 1 ph&ograve;ng ngủ ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n bằng 2 ph&ograve;ng ngủ nhỏ c&oacute; giường ngủ kiểu phương T&acirc;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HQ11dCDyxoO1O6xxhRlloodjg9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> Ph&ograve;ng ngủ truyền thống c&ograve;n lại được thay thế bằng ph&ograve;ng ngủ lớn c&oacute; ph&ograve;ng tắm ri&ecirc;ng, v&agrave; 1 ph&ograve;ng tắm lớn đối diện cầu thang.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A71AdW2Ulob03txc81glg8CIgMc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UtRwdcDwxoMgP1xT9X6llcSlgVg\">\n<div>\n<div>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, m&igrave;nh sẽ phải nhắc tới <strong>ph&ograve;ng ngủ truyền thống kiểu Nhật</strong> v&agrave; <strong>bố cục</strong><strong> (truyền thống/hiện đại)</strong> nhiều, bạn tham khảo một số c&aacute;ch để paraphrase sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MRhndqz8yolnOwx7HoFlnS4ngzc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Traditional Japanese bedroom:</strong> tatami bedrooms, the so-called traditional rooms with sliding doors</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fyhld9mLIofs33xY7M9l3B8dgBg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Floor plans:</strong> interior, layout, design</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4urdk0mtohEi5x0D1Tl3KANgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Modern:</strong> contemporary</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LgPkd7sg9oBxvWxiYGAlGEVSg5x\">\n<div>\n<div>Ngo&agrave;i ra, c&oacute; 1 c&aacute;ch để paraphrase cho bố cục hiện đại trong tiếng Anh sau khi đ&atilde; nhắc tới bố cục truyền thống như sau:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JuD5dySrUocs2DxzD8elmwy9gqb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Its </strong>(modern/contemporary)<strong> counterpart:</strong> phần tương xứng \"kia\" (hiện đại) của n&oacute; (bố cục truyền thống) || chỉ d&ugrave;ng được khi đ&atilde; nhắc tới bố cục truyền thống trước đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ThhIdMK8toK4hbxVQAWlpNx8gAg\">\n<div>\n<div>V&agrave; b&ecirc;n cạnh đ&oacute;, m&igrave;nh cũng học th&ecirc;m một số cụm từ tả vị tr&iacute; nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yz2cdaXRdoRwgcxmuWMlTzJRg4e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>At the other end and along the shorter side: </strong>ở ph&iacute;a ngược lại v&agrave; s&aacute;t bề rộng của căn nh&agrave;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsRjdgkbbok2GKxXtKilFB4hgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Is</strong> <strong>reoriented along the longer side: </strong>được xoay lại theo chiều dọc</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XxUNdOVTConVVExi23UltdtDgm1\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>At the top of the floor plan: </strong>ở khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n của layout.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Changes at a zoo in Australia between 1960 and now</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải </strong><strong>th&iacute;ch </strong><strong>đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả những thay đổi đ&atilde; diễn ra tại một sở th&uacute; ở Australia giữa năm 1960 v&agrave; hiện tại.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề&nbsp; với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: những thay đổi được thực hiện ở sở th&uacute; -&nbsp;\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">từ năm 1960 đến hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Maps, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về những thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2FVdfJ0poHUFaxZXjWl4zeEgsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những thay đổi nổi bật nhất:</strong> Th&ecirc;m <strong>c&aacute;c phương tiện giao th&ocirc;ng hiện đại (Ferry, Cable Car)</strong> v&agrave; 2 <strong>lối v&agrave;o mới</strong>. <strong>Animal enclosures</strong> được <strong>reorganize </strong>ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n: một số bị <strong>remove</strong>, một số được <strong>.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ELJudHj9coLcrAxKkdZlua63gUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những điểm kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi: </strong>Một số <strong>recreational facilities</strong> như <strong>Gift Shop</strong>, <strong>Picnic Area</strong>, v&agrave; <strong>Australian animals enclosure</strong> vẫn được <strong>preserve.</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm khu vực<strong> dựa tr&ecirc;n khu vực:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả khu vực ph&iacute;a Bắc v&agrave; c&aacute;c điểm ra v&agrave;o (Northern area &amp; Access points)</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ok5od1Rt9oTgPxxGxITlmtCbgOk\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> M&ocirc; tả sự di chuyển của <strong>Harbour </strong>từ g&oacute;c phải-tr&ecirc;n (1960) sang g&oacute;c tr&aacute;i-tr&ecirc;n (now).</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ok5od1Rt9oTgPxxGxITlmtCbgOk\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> M&ocirc; tả thay đổi lớn - chỗ <strong>Seal Show </strong>cũ (ở vị tr&iacute; đ&ocirc;ng bắc năm 1960) giờ đ&atilde; trở th&agrave;nh một lối v&agrave;o mới (<strong>entrance</strong>) kết nối với <strong>Ferry terminal </strong>ở ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n-giữa, cung cấp water-based access.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ok5od1Rt9oTgPxxGxITlmtCbgOk\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 3</strong>: Đề cập đến lối v&agrave;o thứ hai (<strong>second entrance</strong>) được thiết lập ở ph&iacute;a dưới-giữa của <strong>site</strong> (đ&acirc;y l&agrave; vị tr&iacute; ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n mới).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: M&ocirc; tả khu vực Animal enclosures v&agrave; Central facilities</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja3ydJ3RMoHaTAxFtzNlYtCxgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> M&ocirc; tả th&ecirc;m mới <strong>Wild animals exhibit</strong> ở khu vực tr&ecirc;n-tr&aacute;i, đồng thời nhắc đến <strong>Australian animals enclosure</strong> vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja3ydJ3RMoHaTAxFtzNlYtCxgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi lớn - <strong>Birds </strong>v&agrave; <strong>Chimpanzees exhibits </strong>(ở khu vực dưới-tr&aacute;i năm 1960) đ&atilde; bị remove ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n, v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng gian n&agrave;y giờ l&agrave; nơi của <strong>Seal Show </strong>(đ&atilde; được relocated từ vị tr&iacute; đ&ocirc;ng bắc cũ).</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja3ydJ3RMoHaTAxFtzNlYtCxgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&acirc;u 3: M&ocirc; tả <strong>African animals enclosure </strong>được relocate từ b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave;o vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m hơn, v&agrave; chiếm một khu vực nhỏ hơn so với trước.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ja3ydJ3RMoHaTAxFtzNlYtCxgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>C&acirc;u 4:</strong> Kết th&uacute;c bằng c&aacute;ch đề cập <strong>Gift Shop</strong> được giữ lại ở vị tr&iacute; giữa-phải v&agrave; đ&atilde; trải qua qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh tr&ugrave;ng tu/cải tạo, v&agrave; <strong>Cable Car system</strong> được lắp đặt ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng gần <strong>Picnic Area</strong> (cũng được preserve).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A71AdW2Ulob03txc81glg8CIgMc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UtRwdcDwxoMgP1xT9X6llcSlgVg\">\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, m&igrave;nh sẽ phải nhắc tới <strong>the zoo/the site</strong> v&agrave; <strong>time periods (1960/now)</strong> nhiều, bạn tham khảo một số c&aacute;ch để paraphrase sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</p>\n<ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>The zoo:</strong> the site, the facility, the venue, the location</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>In 1960:</strong> originally, previously, in the past, in the earlier layout, in the initial design</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Now/at present:</strong> currently, today, in the modern/contemporary layout, at present</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Ngo&agrave;i ra, c&oacute; 1 c&aacute;ch để paraphrase cho <strong>the modern layout</strong> trong tiếng Anh sau khi đ&atilde; nhắc tới layout truyền thống/năm 1960 trước đ&oacute; như sau:</p>\n<ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Its modern/contemporary counterpart:</strong> phần tương ứng \"hiện tại\" của n&oacute; (layout năm 1960) || chỉ d&ugrave;ng được khi đ&atilde; nhắc tới layout cũ trước đ&oacute;</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">V&agrave; b&ecirc;n cạnh đ&oacute;, m&igrave;nh cũng học th&ecirc;m một số cụm từ tả <strong>vị tr&iacute;</strong> v&agrave; <strong>sự thay đổi</strong> nh&eacute;:</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Describing locations:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>In the top right/left corner:</strong> ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n phải/tr&aacute;i</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>At the top/bottom center:</strong> ở giữa ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n/dưới</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>On the western/eastern side:</strong> ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y/Đ&ocirc;ng</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>In the upper/lower section:</strong> ở khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n/dưới</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Adjacent to / next to:</strong> kế b&ecirc;n, liền kề</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Where X once stood:</strong> ở chỗ m&agrave; X từng đứng/tọa lạc (nhấn mạnh sự thay thế)</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Describing changes:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Has been relocated from... to...:</strong> đ&atilde; được di chuyển từ... đến...</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Has been removed/eliminated:</strong> đ&atilde; bị loại bỏ/x&oacute;a bỏ</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Has been added/introduced/installed:</strong> đ&atilde; được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o/đưa v&agrave;o/lắp đặt</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Has been retained/preserved/maintained:</strong> đ&atilde; được giữ lại/bảo tồn</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
