            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the zoo has undergone substantial redevelopment, with the most notable changes being the introduction of modern transport infrastructure and a complete reorganization of animal enclosures. While certain recreational facilities have been preserved, the zoo now features enhanced accessibility and a different distribution of animal exhibits.</p>",
            "question_id": 24489,
