            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the northern section and visitor access, the harbour has been relocated from the top right corner in 1960 to the top left of the site. More significantly, where the seal show once stood in the northeast, there is now a new entrance connected to a ferry terminal at the top center, providing visitors with water-based access to the zoo. Additionally, a second entrance has been established at the bottom center of the site.</p>",
            "question_id": 24489,
